        "procedure": "A mixed methanol solution of DyCl3·6H2O, 8-hydroxyquinoline (Hql), and xanthene-9-carboxylic acid (HXa) was sealed in a 20 mL pressure-resistant borosilicate vial and heated at 70 °C for 72 h in a temperature-calibrated oven. After cooling to room temperature at 10 °C min−1, orange flake crystals of 1 were obtained.",
